Corollary \ref{cor: Variational formulation v} (with $H_0 = A = 0$, and $B(t) = a (\cos \omega t)$) leads to the following problem:
    \begin{equation}
        \min_{u \in \Hone(-1, 1)} \left( \abs{u(0) - \eta_0}^2 + \int_0^1 \diff t \abs{iu'(t) - a (\cos \omega t) u(t)}^2 \right).
    \end{equation}
